  "scope": "Every finite simple subcubic graph whose degree-three vertices are independent and each lie on a cycle of length at most four has a (1,2,3,4)-packing coloring. Arbitrary connector lengths, leaves and disconnected graphs are included. This is [arXiv:2603.25113v1 §5 Conjecture 1](https://arxiv.org/html/2603.25113v1#S5).",
